# slot into tiles of up to NATIVE_TILE_M (8); one work-group row per tile
# decodes the expert's weights once for all its pairs. Each pair keeps the
# one-token arithmetic; its output bytes equal the per-pair and batched
# kernels' by measurement on the A770, not by construction. The
# default policy is grouped for calls of 64+ pairs and batched below; the
# pairs table is written through the usm_host pointer. MOE_DISPATCH_MODE
# selects pair|batched|grouped|auto.
#
--- a/src/plugins/intel_gpu/src/graph/impls/ocl_v2/moe_expert_swiglu.cl
